{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1bb47a2e-8431-8461-83c7-75f52cb9206d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T13:15:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivone Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:12:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. How can I help you this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:12:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Beth. [pause] Good afternoon. My name is Ivone Gomes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:12:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Ivone! Nice to talk to you. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am calling... for my mother. [pause] She is right here. Sitting beside me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, well hello to your mom too! Is she signed up for something with us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. A chair exercise class. [pause] At the senior center. She was so looking forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's a nice one. Did something happen with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was cancelled. [pause] We got a little note. Not enough people, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, that does happen, I'm sorry. So you'd like a refund for the class?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. [pause] That would be good. We paid already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, we can look into that. Do you remember what you paid, or when you signed up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:13:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um... [pause] I think it was forty. Maybe. [pause] Mama, how much was it? [pause] She says forty dollars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, forty dollars. That helps. And what name was the registration under?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:14:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Under my mother. [pause] Gomes also. Same as mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:14:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Can you spell the first name for me, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is Alda. A, L, D, A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got her. Alda Gomes, chair exercise, cancelled session. I see it right here. I'll put in the refund request, and it goes back to the card you used, usually in a week or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that is wonderful. [pause] Thank you. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:14:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Happy to do it. Do you want me to call you when it's processed, or is the card statement enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:14:52-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call would be nice. [pause] My number is four, zero, one. [pause] Five, five, five. [pause] Zero, one, nine, four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:15:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-four. Got it. And if they run that class again next session, I can let you know about that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:15:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. She would like that. [pause] She is smiling now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:15:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aw, tell her we'll get her back in a class soon. You have a lovely afternoon, Ivone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Beth. [pause] Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T13:15:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye bye now!"
    }
  ],
